[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0010","text":"……嗯……\n唔……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0020","text":"……怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0030","text":"我在看晚饭的菜单～\n有个超难念的菜名～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0040","text":"哪个？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0050","text":"啊……\n看不懂呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0060","text":"冬优子能读吗～？\n就是这个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0070","text":"嗯……\n“鰤鱼幽庵烧”……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0080","text":"哦，冬优子\n果然厉害啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0085","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0090","text":"啊，不过\n幽庵烧是什么“烧”法啊？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0095","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_04_0100","text":"…………\n……谁知道呢？"}]
